\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 The Argument:
\f1\b0  This highlights the deep antiquity of the connection. Long before 
\f3\i \uc0\u257 sana
\f1\i0  becameized into internal meditative hatha postures, it was a literal, physical seat that operated within a network of caste pollution and purification. The fact that 
\f3\i Baudh\uc0\u257 yana
\f1\i0  links the 
\f3\i ca\uc0\u7751 \u7693 \u257 la's
\f1\i0  pollution of an 
\f3\i \uc0\u257 sana
\f1\i0  to purification by 
