\f3\i V\uc0\u257 jasenay\u299 sa\u7747 hit\u257 \'92s
\f1\i0  esoteric declaration pairing the 
\f3\i Ca\uc0\u7751 \u7693 \u257 la
\f1\i0  with the wind and the 
\f3\i va\uc0\u7747 \u347 a-nartinam
\f1\i0  (bamboo pole-dancer) with the air. It implies a shared cosmological terrain where outcaste performers and environmental forces (wind/air) handle the edges of physical reality.\
